@startuml Processing Layer
title Figure Processing Layer of the Proposed Virtual Fitting System

top to bottom direction

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam nodesep 60
skinparam ranksep 90

package "Presentation Layer" as Presentation {
    component "React Web Application\n(User Interface)" as React
}

package "Application Layer" as Application {
    component "FastAPI Backend\n(Business Logic & API Services)" as FastAPI
}

package "Processing Layer" as Processing {

    component "Garment Processing Module" as GarmentProcessing

    component "Computer Vision Module\n(OpenCV + MediaPipe)" as ComputerVision

    component "Avatar Generation Module" as AvatarGeneration

    component "Recommendation Module" as Recommendation

    component "Visualization Module\n(Three.js)" as Visualization
}

FastAPI --> GarmentProcessing : Validate garment data
GarmentProcessing --> FastAPI : Valid garment data

FastAPI --> ComputerVision : Process body video
ComputerVision --> AvatarGeneration : Estimated\nmeasurements

FastAPI --> Visualization : Render fitting

AvatarGeneration --> Recommendation : Avatar data

Recommendation --> FastAPI : Recommended size

Visualization --> React : Display results

@enduml